   {
    "en": "With Teacher Iris"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Iris, a foreign teacher who came to Harue-cho, where there are only rice fields and mountains, is beautiful. The chest is big, it looks soft, and the eyelashes are shining. She is a popular person wherever she goes. Such a teacher has a secret. The teacher... she loves my \"smell\"!",
   "ja": "田んぼと山しかない春江町にやってきた外国人教師のイリス先生はキレイだ。胸が大きくて、やわらかそうで、まつげがキラキラしてる。どこに行っても人気者だ。そんな先生には秘密がある。"
  },
